000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. PRMEXTR.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE MAINFRAME BILLING.
000400*================================================================
000500* PRMEXTR  NIGHTLY PREMIUM EXTRACT              PRMNIGHT STEP010
000600*
000700* READS THE POLICY MASTER (VSAM KSDS CORV.POLMAST, COPY POLREC)
000800* AND WRITES EVERY IN-FORCE POLICY WHOSE NEXT BILL DATE IS ON OR
000900* BEFORE THE RUN DATE TO CORV.PRM.EXTRACT FOR PRMCALC.
001000* RUN DATE COMES FROM PARMLIB MEMBER PRMPARM01 (DD PARMIN).
001100* LINES SWITCHED OFF IN PRMPARM02 (DD LINESIN) ARE SKIPPED.
001200*
001300* CHANGE LOG
001400* 2014-06 ORIGINAL VERSION.
001500* 2019-03 MANTENIMIENTO: SE AGREGO EL FILTRO DE LINEAS DE NEGOCIO
001600*         (PRMPARM02) PARA EXCLUIR LA CARGA MARITIMA. J.R.
001700* 2023-11 US POLICIES ADDED (POL-REGION 'US').
001800*================================================================
001900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002000 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002100 FILE-CONTROL.
002200     SELECT POLMAST ASSIGN TO POLMAST
002300         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
002400         ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
002500         RECORD KEY IS POL-NUMBER
002600         FILE STATUS IS WS-POLMAST-FS.
002700     SELECT EXTRACT-FILE ASSIGN TO EXTRACT
002800         FILE STATUS IS WS-EXTRACT-FS.
002900     SELECT PARM-FILE ASSIGN TO PARMIN.
003000     SELECT LINES-FILE ASSIGN TO LINESIN.
003100 DATA DIVISION.
003200 FILE SECTION.
003300 FD  POLMAST.
003400     COPY POLREC.
003500 FD  EXTRACT-FILE
003600     RECORDING MODE IS F.
003700 01  EXTRACT-REC                 PIC X(400).
003800 FD  PARM-FILE.
003900 01  PARM-CARD                   PIC X(80).
004000 FD  LINES-FILE.
004100 01  LINE-CARD                   PIC X(80).
004200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004300 01  WS-FILE-STATUS.
004400     05  WS-POLMAST-FS           PIC X(02).
004500     05  WS-EXTRACT-FS           PIC X(02).
004600 01  WS-SWITCHES.
004700     05  WS-EOF-SW               PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
004800         88  WS-EOF              VALUE 'Y'.
004900     05  WS-PARM-EOF-SW          PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
005000         88  WS-PARM-EOF         VALUE 'Y'.
005100 01  WS-RUN-DATE                 PIC 9(08) VALUE ZERO.
005200 01  WS-LINE-TABLE.
005300     05  WS-LINE-ENTRY OCCURS 12 TIMES INDEXED BY WS-LX.
005400         10  WS-LINE-CODE        PIC X(03).
005500         10  WS-LINE-ACTIVE      PIC X(01).
005600 01  WS-LINE-COUNT               PIC 9(02) VALUE ZERO.
005700 01  WS-COUNTERS.
005800     05  WS-READ-CNT             PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
005900     05  WS-WRITTEN-CNT          PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
006000     05  WS-SKIP-STATUS-CNT      PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
006100     05  WS-SKIP-LINE-CNT        PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
006200     05  WS-NOT-DUE-CNT          PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
006300 01  WS-DATE-PARMS.
006400     05  WS-DU-FUNCTION          PIC X(01).
006500     05  WS-DU-DATE-1            PIC 9(08).
006600     05  WS-DU-DATE-2            PIC 9(08).
006700     05  WS-DU-DAYS              PIC S9(07) COMP-3.
006800     05  WS-DU-RC                PIC 9(02).
006900 01  WS-DISPLAY-CNT              PIC Z(8)9.
007000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
007100 0000-MAIN.
007200     PERFORM 1000-INITIALISE
007300     PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-POLICY UNTIL WS-EOF
007400     PERFORM 9000-TERMINATE
007500     GOBACK.
007600 1000-INITIALISE.
007700     OPEN INPUT POLMAST PARM-FILE LINES-FILE
007800          OUTPUT EXTRACT-FILE
007900     IF WS-POLMAST-FS NOT = '00'
008000         DISPLAY 'PRMEXTR: POLMAST OPEN FAILED ' WS-POLMAST-FS
008100         MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
008200         STOP RUN
008300     END-IF
008400     PERFORM 1100-READ-PARMS
008500     PERFORM 1200-LOAD-LINES
008600     PERFORM 8000-READ-POLMAST.
008700 1100-READ-PARMS.
008800*    PRMPARM01 CARDS ARE KEYWORD=VALUE. ONLY RUNDATE IS USED HERE.
008900     PERFORM UNTIL WS-PARM-EOF
009000         READ PARM-FILE
009100             AT END SET WS-PARM-EOF TO TRUE
009200             NOT AT END
009300                 IF PARM-CARD(1:8) = 'RUNDATE='
009400                     IF PARM-CARD(9:6) = '*TODAY'
009500                         ACCEPT WS-RUN-DATE FROM DATE YYYYMMDD
009600                     ELSE
009700                         MOVE PARM-CARD(9:8) TO WS-RUN-DATE
009800                     END-IF
009900                 END-IF
010000         END-READ
010100     END-PERFORM
010200     IF WS-RUN-DATE = ZERO
010300         ACCEPT WS-RUN-DATE FROM DATE YYYYMMDD
010400     END-IF
010500     MOVE 'V' TO WS-DU-FUNCTION
010600     MOVE WS-RUN-DATE TO WS-DU-DATE-1
010700     CALL 'DATEUTL' USING WS-DATE-PARMS
010800     IF WS-DU-RC NOT = ZERO
010900         DISPLAY 'PRMEXTR: INVALID RUN DATE ' WS-RUN-DATE
011000         MOVE 12 TO RETURN-CODE
011100         STOP RUN
011200     END-IF.
011300 1200-LOAD-LINES.
011400*    PRMPARM02: ONE CARD PER LINE, CODE IN COLS 1-3, Y/N IN COL 5.
011500     MOVE 'N' TO WS-PARM-EOF-SW
011600     PERFORM UNTIL WS-PARM-EOF OR WS-LINE-COUNT = 12
011700         READ LINES-FILE
011800             AT END SET WS-PARM-EOF TO TRUE
011900             NOT AT END
012000                 IF LINE-CARD(1:1) NOT = '*'
012100                     ADD 1 TO WS-LINE-COUNT
012200                     MOVE LINE-CARD(1:3)
012300                       TO WS-LINE-CODE(WS-LINE-COUNT)
012400                     MOVE LINE-CARD(5:1)
012500                       TO WS-LINE-ACTIVE(WS-LINE-COUNT)
012600                 END-IF
012700         END-READ
012800     END-PERFORM.
012900 2000-PROCESS-POLICY.
013000     ADD 1 TO WS-READ-CNT
013100     EVALUATE TRUE
013200         WHEN NOT POL-IN-FORCE
013300             ADD 1 TO WS-SKIP-STATUS-CNT
013400         WHEN POL-NEXT-BILL-DATE > WS-RUN-DATE
013500             ADD 1 TO WS-NOT-DUE-CNT
013600         WHEN OTHER
013700             PERFORM 2100-CHECK-LINE
013800     END-EVALUATE
013900     PERFORM 8000-READ-POLMAST.
014000 2100-CHECK-LINE.
014100     SET WS-LX TO 1
014200     SEARCH WS-LINE-ENTRY
014300         AT END
014400*            A LINE MISSING FROM PRMPARM02 IS TREATED AS ACTIVE
014500             PERFORM 2200-WRITE-EXTRACT
014600         WHEN WS-LINE-CODE(WS-LX) = POL-LINE-CODE
014700             IF WS-LINE-ACTIVE(WS-LX) = 'Y'
014800                 PERFORM 2200-WRITE-EXTRACT
014900             ELSE
015000                 ADD 1 TO WS-SKIP-LINE-CNT
015100             END-IF
015200     END-SEARCH.
015300 2200-WRITE-EXTRACT.
015400     WRITE EXTRACT-REC FROM POL-RECORD
015500     ADD 1 TO WS-WRITTEN-CNT.
015600 8000-READ-POLMAST.
015700     READ POLMAST NEXT RECORD
015800         AT END SET WS-EOF TO TRUE
015900     END-READ.
016000 9000-TERMINATE.
016100     CLOSE POLMAST PARM-FILE LINES-FILE EXTRACT-FILE
016200     MOVE WS-READ-CNT TO WS-DISPLAY-CNT
016300     DISPLAY 'PRMEXTR POLICIES READ      ' WS-DISPLAY-CNT
016400     MOVE WS-WRITTEN-CNT TO WS-DISPLAY-CNT
016500     DISPLAY 'PRMEXTR POLICIES EXTRACTED ' WS-DISPLAY-CNT
016600     MOVE WS-NOT-DUE-CNT TO WS-DISPLAY-CNT
016700     DISPLAY 'PRMEXTR NOT YET DUE        ' WS-DISPLAY-CNT
016800     MOVE WS-SKIP-LINE-CNT TO WS-DISPLAY-CNT
016900     DISPLAY 'PRMEXTR LINE SWITCHED OFF  ' WS-DISPLAY-CNT
017000     IF WS-WRITTEN-CNT = ZERO
017100         MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE
017200     END-IF.
